When not mounted, polearms (and lances) only work properly if the
monster is non-adjacent. If you are meleeing with a polearm when on
foot you get the "bashing" message, which is a hint that you are not
doing as much damage as you could. This is not a bonus for riders; the
damage done when meleeing while riding is the same as "applying".
There *is* a special bonus for "jousting" while riding, but that
requires a lance.

